_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Select Topic Area\n\nBug\n\n### Copilot Feature Area\n\nCopilot in GitHub\n\n### Body\n\nHello,\n\nI have accidentally enabled an experimental feature on my account, and it has broken the user interface in conversations. I am now unable to use the code sections properly.\n\nThis happened yesterday when I was in a conversation view. I saw a small notification with a button that said \"Feeling Lucky\". After I clicked it, the UI changed and became unusable.\n\nI have already tried the following troubleshooting steps with no success:\n- Clearing all browser cache and cookies.\n- Using a different browser.\n- Using a different computer.\n- Using Incognito/Private mode.\n\nSince the issue persists across all devices and browsers, it's clear that this is an account-level feature flag that has been enabled for my user\n\nThere is no option in my account settings to disable this experimental feature. Could you please help me about this?\n\n<img width=\"348\" alt=\"1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4cd66c18-89ed-4cf7-977d-52f24d902e47\" />\n\n<img width=\"334\" alt=\"2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c44cdc96-0704-4765-9368-02636cd3c74f\" />\n\nIn both images, you are looking at the same conversation. As shown in the images, when I enter a prompt in the first image, the response appears with a nice layout, but after exiting the conversation (as you can see in image 2), the appearance gets distorted. Each piece that you see can be regenerated.\n\nThank you for your help.","closed_by":{"login":"Yoyokrazy","id":12552271,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTUyMjcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12552271?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yoyokrazy","html_url":"https://github.com/Yoyokrazy","followers_url":"https://ap